OL,3,ACharlie Kirk murder suspect pleads not
OL,4,Aguilty as judge clears way for death
OL,5,Apenalty trial
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 23-year-old Utah man has pleaded not
OL,8,Fguilty to the murder of conservative
OL,9,Factivist Charlie Kirk ` as a judge
OL,10,Fruled prosecutors can seek the death
OL,11,Fpenalty at trial.
OL,13,FTyler Robinson denies aggravated
OL,14,Fmurder, a capital offence in Utah, and
OL,15,Fsix other charges in connection with
OL,16,Fthe shooting of Kirk at a campus event
OL,17,Fon 10 September 2025.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
