OL,3,ATiger Woods to change plea after crash
OL,4,Aarrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FTiger Woods is to change his plea in
OL,7,Fcourt five months after he was arrested
OL,8,Fon a charge of driving under the
OL,9,Finfluence in a rollover crash in
OL,10,FFlorida.
OL,12,FCourt records show the change of plea
OL,13,Fhearing is set for Wednesday morning in
OL,14,FMartin County, Florida. The golfer was
OL,15,Farrested after the March crash, and had
OL,16,Fpassed a breathalyser test but declined
OL,17,Ffurther testing for other drugs.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
