OL,3,AZelensky says airlines should avoid
OL,4,ARussian airspace as Ukraine escalates
OL,5,Adrone operations
OL,6,
OL,7,FMost Western commercial airlines do not
OL,8,Ffly over Russia as a consequence of the
OL,9,Fongoing Russian invasion of Ukraine,
OL,10,Fbut carriers in countries such as China
OL,11,Fdo.
OL,13,FRussian President Vladimir Putin
OL,14,Fresponded by saying that Zelensky's
OL,15,Fcomments amounted to a "declaration of
OL,16,Fstate terrorism", while adding that
OL,17,FRussia would continue its own
OL,18,Fintensifying attacks on Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
